{"id":"n67479-1-8","stage":2,"title":"연기 · 演技","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67479-1-8-1","ko":"너도 요즘 매일 밤 아홉 시에 하는 드라마를 보니?","zh":"你最近也在看那部每晚九点播出的电视剧吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너도","audio":"/audio/31b5ecd28525b86681fe.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"매일","meaning":"每日，天天","explanation":"매일：每日，天天。","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58103","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}},{"text":"밤","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}},{"text":"아홉","meaning":"九","explanation":"아홉：九。","readings":[{"term":"아홉","audio":"/audio/20ed618de39e3d7de102.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29609","senseId":"1","lemma":"아홉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아홉","audio":"/audio/20ed618de39e3d7de102.mp3"}},{"text":"시에","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시에","audio":"/audio/d114a7f7c3eca4fa0970.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"播出（电视剧）","explanation":"아홉 시에 하는 드라마 是九点播出的电视剧；时间修饰电视剧的播出，不一定是听话人实际观看的时间。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"드라마를","meaning":"电视剧，连续剧","explanation":"드라마：电视剧，连续剧；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"드라마","audio":"/audio/48196dde09d3559f1d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61389","senseId":"1","lemma":"드라마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드라마를","audio":"/audio/708fbfb5c5e94b93bdd0.mp3"}},{"text":"보니?","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"每日，天天","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58103","definition":"一天一天的每一天。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"20ed618de39e3d7d","term":"아홉","zh":"九","audio":"/audio/20ed618de39e3d7de102.mp3","entryId":"29609","definition":"八加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["아홉"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"播出（电视剧）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"播出（电视剧）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"48196dde09d3559f","term":"드라마","zh":"电视剧，连续剧","audio":"/audio/48196dde09d3559f1d2b.mp3","entryId":"61389","definition":"在影院上映或电视上播放的剧。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/321df9c6045e03f7278f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67479-1-8-2","ko":"아니. 배우들이 연기를 너무 못해서 안 봐.","zh":"不是的。演员们的演技太差了，所以我不看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니.","meaning":"不是，不用，不要","explanation":"아니：不是，不用，不要。","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"배우들이","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배우들이","audio":"/audio/adf9adeba0c0160d91b7.mp3"}},{"text":"연기를","meaning":"演技","explanation":"연기：演技；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"연기","audio":"/audio/8b0e2bb594ceb0c31f20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67479","senseId":"1","lemma":"연기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연기를","audio":"/audio/29e7b4de41a38e66bb48.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"못해서","meaning":"做得不好（演技差），所以……","explanation":"연기를 못하다 指演得不好，不是完全不会演戏；-어서 表原因。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91168","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못해서","audio":"/audio/6246c5e314db9f94c74b.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不是，不用，不要","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65982","definition":"用于否定回答晚辈或年龄、地位等相等的人所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"8b0e2bb594ceb0c3","term":"연기","zh":"演技","audio":"/audio/8b0e2bb594ceb0c31f20.mp3","entryId":"67479","definition":"演员根据扮演的角色表现人物、性格、行动等的行为。","pronunciation":["연ː기"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"做不好、做不到一定水准","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"91168","definition":"做不好、做不到一定水准","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c997435e2a633081407.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.767,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67479","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":86,"sequenceScore":2.3646,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你最近也在看那部每晚九点播出的电视剧吗？","不是的。演员们的演技太差了，所以我不看。","去釜山的大巴还有票吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你最近也是每晚九点看那部剧吗？","不是的。演员们的演技太差了，所以我不看。","去釜山的大巴还有票吗？"],"answer":1}]}
